y stage of the hiring process should contact the Office of Human Resources at (937) 327-7517 or email hure-mail@wittenberg.edu. Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs) Powered by Hide Main Navigation Wittenberg University Wittenberg Ave, Springfield, OH 45501-0720"
